kartcheck.mjs\u001b[90m [offset\n\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mgrep -n \"^import\" src/games/MarioKart/sim.js src/games/MarioKart/plann", "qa": "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mecho \"=== remote branches (qa/ + forge/) ===\"; git branch -r 2>&1 | gr\n\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mecho \"=== ALL open issues (any label) ===\"; gh issue list --state open"}}], "issues": [{"number": 187, "title": "GAME \u2014 Super Mario Kart", "state": "open", "body": "as close to original as you can get but by building your own assets.", "labels": [{"name": "building"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/187", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 180, "title": "QA \u2014 Forge: auto-recover from hung sessions (oMLX restart / dead requests)", "state": "open", "body": "**where:** https://jalfern.com/retrogames/forge", "labels": [{"name": "feedback"}, {"name": "building-qa"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/180", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 179, "title": "QA \u2014 The forge itself", "state": "open", "body": "**where:** https://jalfern.com/retrogames/", "labels": [{"name": "feedback"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/179", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 177, "title": "GAME \u2014 The Legend of Zelda", "state": "open", "body": "Build out NES Legend of Zelda as close to the original as possible. To make it tractable, start with either a 2x2 or 3x3 set of screens from this ", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}, {"name": "stalled"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/177", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 169, "title": "GAME \u2014 Spy Hunter!", "state": "open", "body": "Go all out. Make it a faithful replica of the original 80s game. Both graphics and gameplay should mimic the original. To keep it contained you only need to build first 2 levels.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/169", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 91, "title": "FORGE PULSE", "state": "open", "body": "Machine-updated status line for https://jalfern.com/retrogames/forge \u2014 do not close.", "labels": [], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/91", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 76, "title": "GAME 12 \u2014 Papers-Please-Min", "state": "open", "body": "Document rules gameplay, generated immigrants. New muscle: rule engine + a prover that no generated paper is unfair.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/76", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 70, "title": "GAME 06 \u2014 Ice Climber Co-op", "state": "open", "body": "Two climbers, dug-through terrain, local 2P. New muscle: mutable tilemap + second simultaneous input path.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/70", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 69, "title": "GAME 05 \u2014 Momentum Runner (Sonic-like)", "state": "open", "body": "Slopes, loops, speed-shifting platforming. New muscle: angle-based collision; levelcheck gets a velocity-reachability audit.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/69", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 176, "title": "GAME \u2014 Excite bike", "state": "closed", "body": "Muscle to stretch is fedility to the original excite bike nes game as possible. graphics, level design, controls -- make it feel close and faithful to the original. take your time, don't worry how long it takes. the closer to a true recreation the better you have achieved the goal.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/176", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 152, "title": "Wizardry! \u2014", "state": "closed", "body": "Build the classic dungeon crawler of early days - wizardry!", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/152", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 143, "title": "Paperboy! (style of nes)", "state": "closed", "body": "build out the original paper boy using style similar to nes (higher end / better than our typical retro games motif). game play and levels should be like the original.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/143", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 103, "title": "GAME 16 \u2014 Forge Conveyor (factory floor visualization)", "state": "closed", "body": "Stretch goal, dogfooding: turn /forge's lamp panel into an animated **factory floor** rendered from the data the board already fetches (pulse tokens + label lists \u2014 no new API calls).", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/103", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 81, "title": "GAME \u2014 beezee. a first person honeybee flier", "state": "closed", "body": "Think Magic Carpet meets Bug's Life. You are a honey bee from a hive that has the goal of finding nectar and bringing back the nectar and pollen to the hive before the sun sets. You have spider webs, wasps, birds, and a pet gecko to contend with. You have an ultraviolet vision mode to zero into the ", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/81", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 79, "title": "GAME 15 \u2014 WWI Dogfight 3D", "state": "closed", "body": "Altitude, stall, ammo belts on a fixed-wing sim. New muscle: flight model + instruments, extends the three.js stack.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/79", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 77, "title": "GAME 13 \u2014 Lode Runner", "state": "closed", "body": "Destructible floors, enemy pathfinding, ghost replay of your own runs. New muscle: determinism + recorded-input harness.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/77", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 75, "title": "GAME 11 \u2014 Outpost Roguelike (Dwarf-style)", "state": "closed", "body": "Jobs, hunger, pathing, procedural depths, ASCII. New muscle: job queue + A* on Rogue's bones.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/75", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 74, "title": "GAME 10 \u2014 SimCity-Min", "state": "closed", "body": "Grid city, economy ticks, disaster mode. New muscle: long-horizon sim + stat harness proving the economy is stable/fun.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/74", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 73, "title": "GAME 09 \u2014 Missile Battle Sim", "state": "closed", "body": "Saturation attacks, intercept math, limited interceptors. New muscle: vector-field simulation + deterministic attack waves.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/73", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 72, "title": "GAME 08 \u2014 Polarity Shooter (Ikaruga-like)", "state": "closed", "body": "Light/dark switching: same-color absorbs, opposite kills. New muscle: rule-driven enemy AI + a fairness auditor.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/72", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 71, "title": "GAME 07 \u2014 Galaga", "state": "closed", "body": "Formation dives, tractor beam, player-capture rescue bonus. New muscle: scripted enemy behavior trees with verifiable dive paths.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/71", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 68, "title": "GAME 04 \u2014 Metroid-lite", "state": "closed", "body": "Scrolling map with ability-gated backtracking, save beacons. New muscle: world-state flow machine + parallax.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/68", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 67, "title": "GAME 03 \u2014 Sonar Roguelike", "state": "closed", "body": "You only see what sound reveals \u2014 ping, listen, map the room in your head. New muscle: deferred-reveal renderer; harness asserts the info the player actually received.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/67", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 66, "title": "GAME 02 \u2014 Boulder Dash", "state": "closed", "body": "Dirt digging, falling boulders and gems, chain-explosion timer. New muscle: cellular automata + heistcheck-style headless reachability/explosion audit.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/66", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}, {"number": 65, "title": "GAME 01 \u2014 Lemmings-lite", "state": "closed", "body": "One-click skill assignment (walker\u2192blocker/climber/digger/bomber), per-lemming agents, deterministic replay. New muscle: agent-per-entity sim; the gate is a Node solver proving each level is solvable before it ships.", "labels": [{"name": "shipped"}], "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/issues/65", "reactions": {"total_count": 0}}], "prs": [{"number": 192, "title": "WIP \u2014 needs Jon's review: SENTINEL \u2014 no-model watchdog for hung lanes (#180)", "html_url": "https://github.com/jalfern/retrogames/pull/192"}], "pulses": [{"id": 6153430089, "body": "12:26 alive=yes queue=0 building=1 shipped=21 main=272cea9 qa=2 mini=up gate=#192 actions=none", "created_at": "2026-10-13T19:26:04Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T19:26:04Z"}, {"id": 6153250218, "body": "12:16 alive=yes queue=0 building=1 shipped=21 main=272cea9 qa=2 mini=up gate=#192 actions=none", "created_at": "2026-10-13T19:16:01Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T19:16:01Z"}, {"id": 6153060382, "body": "12:05 alive=yes queue=0 building=1 shipped=21 main=4de697c qa=2 mini=up gate=#195 a